00:05:42.467 --> 00:05:44.167
Like, acting is a whole
different,

00:05:44.167 --> 00:05:45.601
entirely different thing.

00:05:45.601 --> 00:05:46.734
-Right.
-Yeah.

00:05:46.734 --> 00:05:48.167
