and -- and I --

00:05:51.701 --> 00:05:53.300
It was like,
lip-shaking nervous.

00:05:53.300 --> 00:05:55.167
Like, face-shaking nervous.

00:05:55.167 --> 00:05:56.801
-I had the worst audition.
-And it was traumatizing.

00:05:56.801 --> 00:05:58.234
So I never did that again.

00:05:58.234 --> 00:06:00.234
-I auditioned for one musical
on Broadway.

00:06:00.234 --> 00:06:02.567
