-"Young Frankenstein."

00:06:02.567 --> 00:06:03.968
-Oh, yeah, Mel Brooks, yeah.

00:06:03.968 --> 00:06:06.000
-It was a disaster audition.

00:06:06.000 --> 00:06:08.601
