00:06:25.300 --> 00:06:28.534
I'm like, "Lightning,
frightening, lightning."

00:06:28.534 --> 00:06:30.100
I go, "Sorry, sorry,
can we start again?

00:06:30.100 --> 00:06:31.634
What was that voice?"

00:06:31.634 --> 00:06:32.701
[ Laughter ]

00:06:32.701 --> 00:06:34.267
