I go, "Let me try again.

00:06:37.901 --> 00:06:39.534
So I go, "Let me try
in a deeper voice."

00:06:39.534 --> 00:06:42.934
And I go, "Let's do it again.
Play the music."

00:06:42.934 --> 00:06:45.968
"Lightning, frightening,
lightning -- What is happening?"

00:06:45.968 --> 00:06:47.434
I go, "I don't know
how to sing anymore."

00:06:47.434 --> 00:06:49.534
[ Laughter ]
And I go -- And it was so bad.

00:06:49.534 --> 00:06:52.534
And I sang like three takes
of this new song,

00:06:52.534 --> 00:06:55.100
and it was so bad,
and she was like,

00:06:55.100 --> 00:06:56.434
