to meet you."

00:06:56.434 --> 00:06:57.934
-No, no, no!
-"Thank you so much."

00:06:57.934 --> 00:06:59.267
And I go, "Okay, take care."

00:06:59.267 --> 00:07:01.934
And I remember walking home
and steam

00:07:01.934 --> 00:07:03.767
was coming off my body.
-No.

00:07:03.767 --> 00:07:06.501
-It was so cold, I was like --
-You were that --

00:07:06.501 --> 00:07:08.334
