00:07:11.767 --> 00:07:12.834
and you're just watching
yourself, like,

00:07:12.834 --> 00:07:14.334
from the ceiling flop
at something, oh.

00:07:14.334 --> 00:07:15.801
-It was the worst audition.
-You're amazing,

00:07:15.801 --> 00:07:16.968
is what we're saying.
You're amazing.

00:07:16.968 --> 00:07:18.434
-Oh, thank you, Shawn.
-Yes, exactly.

00:07:18.434 --> 00:07:19.901
Gonna bring it back to you.
-Bring it back to me, yeah.

00:07:19.901 --> 00:07:21.667
-Yes, yeah, bring it
back to you.

00:07:21.667 --> 00:07:23.634
I want to mention
this documentary if I can.

00:07:23.634 --> 00:07:25.467
-Yeah, for sure. It's a --

